perties:\n\n- if $|r|<1,$ the sequence is convergent and converges to $0$\n\n- if $|r|>1,$ the sequence is divergent\n\nMoreover, we have the following edge cases:\n\n- if $r=1,$ the sequence is convergent and converges to ${a}_{1}$\n\n- if $r=-1,$ the sequence is divergent\n\nThe given sequence ${a}_{n}=2{(\\frac{2}{3})}^{n}$ is a geometric sequence with the common ratio $r=\\frac{2}{3}.$ \n\nSince $|r|<1,$ the sequence converges to $0.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-5521173e-4fd0-569c-b113-b91da149682d"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-5521173e-4fd0-569c-b113-b91da149682d" :answer-field/id #uuid "5521173e-4fd0-569c-b113-b91da149682d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-22b7211e-dd6c-5a3e-88e8-d3edd2915633" :answer-field/choices ["answer-22b7211e-dd6c-5a3e-88e8-d3edd2915633" "answer-909b2006-2b10-5c79-9d1c-af317380a62c" "answer-6d1afbe3-f463-50af-b060-99529ce98d35" "answer-9c753113-557c-5b1c-8957-36be50789e48" "answer-1e72f358-8b3c-5fa0-a87f-b5c3e703b4d3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-22b7211e-dd6c-5a3e-88e8-d3edd2915633" :answer/id #uuid "22b7211e-dd6c-5a3e-88e8-d3edd2915633" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $0$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-909b2006-2b10-5c79-9d1c-af317380a62c" :answer/id #uuid "909b2006-2b10-5c79-9d1c-af317380a62c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $2$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6d1afbe3-f463-50af-b060-99529ce98d35" :answer/id #uuid "6d1afbe3-f463-50af-b060-99529ce98d35" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $\\frac{2}{3}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9c753113-557c-5b1c-8957-36be50789e48" :answer/id #uuid "9c753113-557c-5b1c-8957-36be50789e48" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $\\frac{4}{3}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {